 "paras": [
  "Please select a valid check-in and check-out date.",
  "You must check this box to proceed.",
  "Located in the heart of Toronto and Prince Edward County, Drake Hotel Properties are boutique hotels that blend culture, community, and hospitality for curious travellers who like to keep things interesting. The Drake is",
  "From Toronto’s vibrant urban core to the scenic charm of Prince Edward County, The Drake’s properties are embedded in storied, character-rich neighbourhoods — offering a one-of-a-kind escape that feels both rooted and re",
  "IN THE HEARTBEAT OF TORONTO — JUST STEPS FROM MAJOR ATTRACTIONS, VENUES, AND THE ENERGY OF THE DOWNTOWN CORE — THE DRAKE STANDS AS A BEACON OF CREATIVITY AND CULTURE. LOCATED ON DYNAMIC QUEEN STREET WEST, THE HOTEL BRING",
  "SET ALONG THE PICTURESQUE SHORES OF LAKE ONTARIO IN BUCOLIC PRINCE EDWARD COUNTY, DRAKE DEVONSHIRE IS A REFINED RETREAT WHERE ART, DESIGN, FOOD + WINE, AND HOSPITALITY INTERSECT. WITH SWEEPING WATERFRONT VIEWS, LOCALLY I",
  "Drake Art is everywhere. From guest rooms to dining spaces, our rotating collection transforms every available corner — wall, nook, or hallway — into a pop-up gallery.",
  "READY FOR A HANDPICKED ADVENTURE THROUGH PEC'S BEST WINERIES?",
  "EVERY DAY 4-6PM: $13 COCKTAILS + 30% OFF OUR FAVOURITE DRAKE PLATES",
  "KATIE PRUITT LIVE AT DRAKE UNDERGROUND."
